      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Since the 1950s, cafés like Café de Flore and Les Deux Magots made the 6th a cradle of surrealism, existentialism, and modern feminism.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
